{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14731","headline":"送李纵别驾加员外郎却赴常州幕 · 卢纶","name":"送李纵别驾加员外郎却赴常州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霄汉正联飞，江湖又独归。\n暂欢同赐被，不待易朝衣。\n山雨迎军晚，芦风候火微。\n还当宴铃阁，谢守亦光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}